    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "Owen Reilly proudly presents No. 91 The Northumberlands — a superbly located third-floor studio apartment with designated parking, set within a secure and mature Cosgrave-built development. Behind its gated entrance, residents enjoy landscaped courtyard gardens, the reassurance of an on-site caretaker, and a quiet, well-managed setting in the heart of Dublin 2.\r\n\r\nThe bright and well-proportioned accommodation comprises an inviting entrance hall leading to a spacious open-plan studio with a comfortable living area, fitted kitchen and Juliet balcony. Cleverly designed fitted cabinetry provides excellent storage and frames the double bed, while a contemporary bathroom and additional storage complete the accommodation.\r\n\r\nA stylish and conveniently located city home in one of Dublin’s most sought-after locations, ideal for those looking to enjoy all that Dublin 2 has to offer. Viewing is highly recommended.\r\n\r\nMore about the location...\r\n\r\nThis prime city address lies between the Grand Canal and Merrion Square, just minutes from Ballsbridge, Grand Canal Dock, Grafton Street, and St. Stephen’s Green. Excellent transport links include Pearse Street DART (c. 9 minutes’ walk), the LUAS at Charlemont, and numerous bus routes. The area is also home to the European headquarters of leading multinationals such as Google, Airbnb, and TikTok."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "Entrance Hallway (2.15m x 0.97m)\r\nSpacious entrance hall with carpet flooring, hot press and storage closet\r\n\r\nBathroom (2.03m X 1.68m)\r\nStylish bathroom with tiled walls and flooring, enclosed shower unit, WHB, WC and illuminated wall mirror.\r\n\r\nKitchen (2.45m X 1.57m)\r\nWell-appointed kitchen with a range of fitted wall and base units, tiled splashback and generous worktop space. Appliances include an oven, electric hob, extractor fan, washing machine and under-counter fridge.\r\n\r\nLiving/Dining/Bedroom (4.76m X 5.51m)\r\nA bright and generously proportioned open-plan room combining comfortable living, dining and bedroom space. The double bed is cleverly framed by extensive fitted cabinetry, providing excellent storage, while the room benefits from a Juliet balcony.\r\n\r\nALL MEASUREMENTS ARE APPROXIMTE AND FOR GUIDANCE ONLY"
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Features",
        "SortOrder": 3,
        "Content": "Third-floor studio apartment.\r\nDesignated parking space.\r\nBright and well-proportioned accommodation.\r\nJuliet balcony.\r\nExcellent fitted storage.\r\nUpgraded contemporary bathroom.\r\nRecently installed boiler.\r\nNewly fitted carpet throughout.\r\nSecure gated development.\r\nLandscaped communal courtyard gardens.\r\nOn-site caretaker.\r\nMature Cosgrave-built development.\r\nPrime Dublin 2 location.\r\nManagement charge c. €2,358 p.a."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "BER Details",
        "SortOrder": 4,
        "Content": "BER: D"
      }
